    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "A {@link PopulationCodec} is not one of the canonical encodings, so {@link CodecEncoding#getSpecifier} must emit a multi-byte specifier: a leading meta-encoding byte (in the population-codec range 141..188) followed by the bytes describing its three sub-codecs. This test verifies that round-tripping such a codec through {@code getSpecifier} and back through {@link CodecEncoding#getCodec} reproduces the original favoured, token and unfavoured codecs."
   },
   {
    "id": "i2",
    "kind": "LineComment",
    "lines": [
